<title>USA: IPO PRICING - ViroPharma not effective.</title>
<headline>IPO PRICING - ViroPharma not effective.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The initial public offering of ViroPharma Inc priced but had not gone effective Tuesday morning, said the lead underwriter for the deal, Cowen &amp; Co.</p>
<p>Exact terms for the deal were not available but the underwriter said information should be out later today.</p>
<p>The 2.25 million share offering was expected to price between $8 and $9 a share, after being decreased from $11 to $13 last week.</p>
<p>The Pennsylvania-based biochemical company will trade on the Nasdaq Market under the symbol &quot;VPHM.&quot;</p>
</text>
